# 1. Official Written Examination Submission Sheet
*(Write these exact 6 points directly onto your answer sheet)*

### 1. Project Title
**Sandboxed: Design and Implementation of a Linux-Based Isolated Program Execution and Resource Monitoring System**

---

### 2. Objective
To design, implement, and evaluate an unprivileged Linux-based execution platform that safely executes untrusted user programs inside isolated sandbox environments using **cgroups v2**, **Linux namespaces**, **bubblewrap (`bwrap`)**, and **seccomp BPF**. 

The system enforces strict multi-tenant boundaries (CPU Completely Fair Scheduler quotas, physical memory limits, process count caps, ephemeral filesystem views, and network isolation), provides real-time asynchronous process supervision with deadlock-free bounded I/O, collects high-resolution kernel telemetry, and offers an interactive developer dashboard with comparative policy experimentation.

---

