4. **Distributed Worker Architecture**: Decouple the execution manager across multiple distributed worker nodes using a message queue (RabbitMQ / Redis) for high-throughput horizontal scaling.
5. **Static Binary & eBPF Security Auditing**: Integrate eBPF runtime probes for real-time anomalous syscall detection and automated security reporting.

